# B7 "Telvanni Hortator": the Telvanni council must vote unanimously, and a
# dead councilor's vote counts as cast. Master Aryon agrees and advises
# killing Archmagister Gothren, who will never answer; Neloth, Therana and
# Dratha agree once well disposed (bribed). Aryon then counts the votes and
# gives the Robe of the Hortator. PositionCell stands in for the walks,
# AddItem for the gold, the console's damageav for the fight with Gothren;
# ref FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from b7_aryon
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Aryon hears the player's story and casts the first vote.
case b7_aryon
run
player->AddItem gold_001 9000
player->PositionCell 3905 2835 15752 0 "Tel Vos, Aryon's Chambers"
until 600 GetPCCell "Tel Vos, Aryon's Chambers" == 1
talk aryon
ask Telvanni Hortator
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex B7_AryonHort >= 50
bye
end

# Gothren never answers, so he dies.
case b7_gothren
run
player->PositionCell 507 -534 64 0 "Tel Aruhn, Upper Tower"
until 600 GetPCCell "Tel Aruhn, Upper Tower" == 1
console 05A0CF30.damageav health 10000
until 300 "gothren"->GetHealth <= 0
end

# Neloth, Therana and Dratha vote once they like the player well enough.
case b7_council
run
player->PositionCell 255 1233 1061 0 "Sadrith Mora, Tel Naga Upper Tower"
until 600 GetPCCell "Sadrith Mora, Tel Naga Upper Tower" == 1
talk neloth
persuade bribe1000
persuade bribe1000
persuade bribe100
persuade bribe100
expect "neloth"->GetDisposition >= 70
ask Telvanni Hortator
expect GetJournalIndex B7_NelothHort == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell 188 1444 -690 0 "Tel Branora, Upper Tower: Therana's Chamber"
until 600 GetPCCell "Tel Branora, Upper Tower: Therana's Chamber" == 1
talk therana
persuade bribe1000
persuade bribe1000
persuade bribe100
persuade bribe100
persuade bribe100
expect "therana"->GetDisposition >= 80
ask Telvanni Hortator
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex B7_TheranaHort == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell -236 -245 985 0 "Tel Mora, Upper Tower"
until 600 GetPCCell "Tel Mora, Upper Tower" == 1
talk dratha
persuade bribe1000
persuade bribe1000
persuade bribe100
persuade bribe100
persuade bribe100
expect "dratha"->GetDisposition >= 80
ask Telvanni Hortator
choose 1
choose 4
expect GetJournalIndex B7_DrathaHort >= 50
bye
end

# Aryon's greeting counts the votes; with all six he names the player
# Hortator and gives the robe.
case b7_hortator
run
player->PositionCell 3905 2835 15752 0 "Tel Vos, Aryon's Chambers"
until 600 GetPCCell "Tel Vos, Aryon's Chambers" == 1
talk aryon
expect HortatorVotes == 6
ask Telvanni Hortator
expect GetJournalIndex B7_TelvanniHort == 70
expect player->GetItemCount hortatorrobe == 1
bye
end
